OL,3,GNEWSACouncil and traders criticised in
OL,4,AMarket Hall review
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review has criticised the reopening
OL,7,Fof Derby's Market Hall after it found
OL,8,Fthe venue had no "clear commercial
OL,9,Fobjectives" and no proper marketing
OL,10,Fplan.
OL,12,FA newly published internal report found
OL,13,F"significant gaps" in planning before
OL,14,Fthe venue reopened in May 2025, as well
OL,15,Fas pricing issues and flawed decisions
OL,16,Fon opening hours.
OL,18,FDocuments released in the summer showed
OL,19,Fthe Market Hall is forecast to make a
OL,20,Floss of #338,000 next year amid ongoing
OL,21,Fstruggles with footfall.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
